%PDF-1.4 ROME & RIDE - RIDER PICKUP & SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS
1. Bring original Govt Photo ID & Driving License to Central Station Hub.
2. Collect vehicle keys and 2 sanitized helmets.
3. Verify digital odometer and fuel level with staff before departure.
4. Emergency Roadside Assistance: +91 98765 99999
5. Return vehicle with clean condition and equal fuel level.